graph TD
    sit[Assessed Situation: Gate congestion] --> hypGen[Hypothesis Generation]
    
    hypGen --> hypA[Hypothesis A: Scanner offline - 10%]
    hypGen --> hypB[Hypothesis B: Queue bottleneck - 65%]
    hypGen --> hypC[Hypothesis C: Medical roadblock - 25%]
    
    hypA --> |Pruning: Network ping OK| pruneA[PRUNED]
    
    hypB --> |Verification: Turnstile count active| checkB[REASONED]
    hypC --> |Verification: No medical dispatch active| checkC[SECONDARY]
    
    checkB --> risk[Multidimensional Risk Matrix]
    risk --> pol[Policy Check validation]
    pol --> rec[Final Recommendation compilation]
